      "content": "the \"balance\" thing is fine for a polite convo but honestly the reps are just gonna hit me with the \"climate change is real\" line to shut me down. can you give me what the actual scientific or economic rebuttals are for their side? i need to know if their arguments even hold water against my costs.",
